      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Lydon Farrell Property present a large 4 bedroom detached house to the market for sale and it is in a superb location... right in the middle of the town centre and within walking distance to an abundance of amenities. No 4 Carraig Dun is on a corner site ideally located within a small private development just off the Cavan Road at the edge of the town centre and it is only a few minutes from the M3 motorway. The house is deceptively large and shaped in such a manner whereby it extends and widens significantly at the rear, to such an extent that there is a bedroom and two sitting rooms on the ground floor.\r\n\r\nPresented in good decorative condition throughout, this property offers an incoming purchaser the opportunity to acquire a 4 bedroom detached property with two fine living rooms with a separate spacious kitchen and dining room on the ground floor. Also on the ground floor is a guest WC and a ground floor bedroom, which could also act as an ideal home office. The large open-plan kitchen/dining area opening off the conservatory, makes it a great space for entertaining in either winter or summer with patio doors to the rear garden.\r\n\r\nSo the ground floor is complete with significant space and options to adapt to all family needs and requirements. The first floor includes a further 3 bedrooms, one with an ensuite and two with fitted wardrobes and family bathroom.\r\n\r\nWithin walking distance of 4 Carraig Dun is the  Cavan/Dublin Bus Eireann Bus Stop, Supervalu and Aldi and the newly opened Eureka Secondary School. Also within walking distance is the town walkway with evening lighting, not to mention a host of shops, coffee shops, hotel, churches, primary and secondary schools and a variety of sporting and recreational clubs.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended and by appointment."
      },
